**Clarified decisions (2026-05-15, 001)**:
- Calendar week Mon–Sun (local TZ) for analytics
- Time leak: ≥60 min current week + >20% vs last week
- Full time entry edit supported
- Mood: great | good | okay | low | bad
- Password min 8 characters

**Clarified decisions (2026-05-17, 003)**:
- Time leaks always calendar week vs prior week; best-hours/correlation use analytics date picker range
- Correlation insight uses productivity score (1–10) only
- Category keywords: registration seeds only; no keyword admin UI in Phase 2
- Reflection streak: current resets to 0 after missed day; longest streak preserved
- Evening reflection nudge: nice-to-have, not blocking

