**Clarified decisions (2026-05-17, 004)**:
- Offline dashboard: best-effort cache (last snapshot or offline message)
- Pending entries show on dashboard/list immediately until synced
- Online for sync: `navigator.onLine` + `GET /api/health` reachability check
- Sync issues: dedicated `/settings/sync` page
- Sign-out: prompt if queue non-empty; clear device queue if sign-out without sync (session expiry keeps queue)
